<title>USA: MGI buys five new properties for $19 mln.</title>
<headline>MGI buys five new properties for $19 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON, Mass. 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>MGI Properties said on Tuesday that it had acquired five properties for an aggregate purchase price of $18.8 million during the second quarter ended May 31.</p>
<p>The properties, which total 330,700 square feet, are anticipated to produce roughly 10.5 percent initial return at their current 99 percent leased level, MGI said in a statement.</p>
